                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ebd00afd-a449-3379-932c-3af6e6e0efa4",
                        "entry_id": "46241a90-2619-3f38-af7d-1d78b627bcec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Symbol des Phallus als Sinnbild Schiwas"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "speziell Hinduismus"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "43e08f47-2758-40de-a1e1-cf37b0ab4238",
                                "sense_id": "ebd00afd-a449-3379-932c-3af6e6e0efa4",
                                "text": "„Die Verbindung von Lingam und Yoni, dem Zeichen des weiblichen Geschlechts, symbolisiert die Vereinigung des Götterpaares Shiva und Kali, die Synthese von männlicher Kraft und kreativer, weiblicher Energie, die mystische ‚Einheit in der Zweiheit‘.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e2785882-eb8d-4d51-a479-9a049474a3a3",
                        "source_entry_id": "46241a90-2619-3f38-af7d-1d78b627bcec",
                        "source_sense_id": "ebd00afd-a449-3379-932c-3af6e6e0efa4",
                        "source_sense_description": "Religion, speziell Hinduismus: Symbol des Phallus als Sinnbild Schiwas",
                        "target_lang_word": "lingam",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lingam",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf26ba7a-c07b-38b1-b08e-c5e81a4f605f",
                                        "entry_id": "60a25362-95ca-39ab-80c2-0403a187dbef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The aniconic phallic representation traditionally worshipped as a symbol of or in connection with Shiva."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f346d5ab-932b-48bb-a0e1-4266142e3ebe",
                                                "sense_id": "cf26ba7a-c07b-38b1-b08e-c5e81a4f605f",
                                                "text": "Then we have the very numerous lingams (conventional representations of the male organ) to be seen, scores and scores of them, in the arcades and cloisters of the Hindu Temples - to which women of all classes, especially those who wish to become mothers, resort, anointing them copiously with oil, and signalizing their respect and devotion to them in a very practical way."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10cc95d2-a1f0-4508-af72-28f4c3e77cc3",
                                                "sense_id": "cf26ba7a-c07b-38b1-b08e-c5e81a4f605f",
                                                "text": "Caylus presents Pan in the act of pouring water upon the male member; that is, invigorating the creative power by the application of the prolific element upon which it acted. In India, it was customary to pour sacred water from the Ganges upon the Lingam, the symbol of Siva."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0dccdd08-2491-3bfc-b579-fe973a76491a",
                                        "entry_id": "60a25362-95ca-39ab-80c2-0403a187dbef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The penis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf701aa2-de45-4eff-96a0-ac9e25b70848",
                                                "sense_id": "0dccdd08-2491-3bfc-b579-fe973a76491a",
                                                "text": "This compound, when applied to the lingam, results in sexual dominance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "930163d1-c5d6-4c70-8b35-3c704cb69f75",
                                                "sense_id": "0dccdd08-2491-3bfc-b579-fe973a76491a",
                                                "text": "When the sages saw the great god Siva so haggard and sad, they treated him with scorn and saluted him only with bent heads.\nSica^([sic – meaning Siva]), tired and weary, asked only for \"alms\". Thus the god went about begging along the roads of Darauvanam.\nAs the women looked at him, they felt a pang in their heart. Their minds were perturbed and their hearts agitated by the sensations of love. They forsook the beds of the sages and followed Siva.\nAs the sages saw their wives following Siva, they pronounced a curse upon him;\n\"May his lingam fall to the ground.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c8df515-f535-4595-95fe-92f98054a755",
                                                "sense_id": "0dccdd08-2491-3bfc-b579-fe973a76491a",
                                                "text": "He still enjoys a tumble with her now as much as when they were youngsters, his voice cracking and his lingam a sprout that seemed never to get soft."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "896f3ef9-72f4-4d00-a958-b3147332239e",
                                                "sense_id": "0dccdd08-2491-3bfc-b579-fe973a76491a",
                                                "text": "I gaze into the starry void, into Dominique’s eyes, into the blackness behind my own sealed eyelids as her lips envelop my lingam, and I feel a feedback channel opening between this creature of obsession and the dormant natural man."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e84ab917-c551-4a9e-8c71-243be8e13403",
                                                "sense_id": "0dccdd08-2491-3bfc-b579-fe973a76491a",
                                                "text": "Once both partners have felt the connection it is up to the woman to give the signal that permission to enter has been granted. She may whisper her invitation to enter, use her hands to guide his lingam, or press against him, causing his lingam to open her."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
